caption: GATES Setting Rules — GATES Attribute Augmentation Caps
technology-rule: gates-attribute-augmentation-caps

GATES cybernetics use the following setting-specific ceilings for cybernetic increases to IQ, DX, and HT. These are technological ceilings, not free levels; the character must still pay the normal character-point cost and meet all structural, power, cooling, control, and Cybernetic Load requirements.
